* B1 | CASPT2 shift sensitivity (compact CAS(12,12), QUINTET)
* Baseline is 03c (ipeashift=0.25, imag=0.2). This variant: IPEA = 0.50.
* See caspt2_Q_ipea00.input header for how to read the outputs.

&GATEWAY
 coord = opt_optimized.xyz
 basis = Def2-TZVP
 group = nosym
 amfi
 RICD

&SEWARD

&RASSCF
 fileorb = rasscf.RasOrb
 cionly
 charge = 0; spin = 5
 nactel = 12 0 0
 inactive = 100
 ras2 = 12
 ciroot = 5 5 1
 thrs = 1.0d-7 1.0d-5 1.0d-5
 outorbital = canonical

&CASPT2
 multistate = 5 1 2 3 4 5
 imag = 0.2
 ipeashift = 0.5
